<meta name='title' content='Stars within 50 light-years as X3D 4.1 Gaussian splats'/>
<meta name='description' content='978 HYG v4.1 stars (plus the Sun) at true 3D positions for the planet-scale zoom, two isotropic splats each: a core sized by absolute magnitude (300 x 10^(-0.12 (M - 4.8)) Gm, clipped 120 to 3000 Gm) and a halo 3.5 times wider at opacity 0.18. Colour from B-V via a blackbody approximation. Positions in units of 10^12 m in the campus east-up-south frame; the Transform restores metres. Orientations x y z w.'/>
<meta name='creator' content='x3d.io planet-scale thread for HagopJay'/>
<meta name='generator' content='Python star-catalogue generator (X3D research showcase)'/>
